# DISC — bare form, the acknowledgement of a DISC.
#
# Source: "M17 Internet Protocol (IP) Networking", "Control Packets", DISC:
# "Acknowledged with 4-byte packet "DISC" (without the callsign field)".
#
#   bytes 0-3   44 49 53 43   Magic, ASCII "DISC"
#
# Total 4 bytes. DISC is the only magic with two legal lengths (4 and 10).
44495343
